WEBVTT

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:10.190
Why?!

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.490
Why did this have to happen?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.480
Shit!

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:13.870
Why?

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:15.940
Why did I have to lose?

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:20.200
I haven't won in so long.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.580
I'm stuck in punishment game hell.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:32.840
God! Buddha! I beg of you, grant me victory!

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.220
K! How can you be so cold?!

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:42.720
Praying to any deity that will listen.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:47.730
Shouldn't you ask your loyal companions for help first?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.850
Tommy, Cloud and Iri!

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:53.860
Soul Brothers, assemble!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.190
Dearest soul brother...

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:59.330
...your problems are our problems.

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:05.490
Let us grant you the power to vanquish the evils of club activities.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.370
Thank you!

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:18.740
K. Why do you want to win?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.010
Have you grown tired of losing?

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.380
Damn right!

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:25.670
I'm getting sick of all these stupid punishment games,

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:28.520
so I want to at least avoid whatever could be left.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.990
The reason you can't win is because you're so hung up on all those defeats.

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:36.730
You're so afraid of getting hit with these punishment games...

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:40.280
...that the beast within you that hungers for victory has grown tame and meek.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:46.370
When you re-awaken that beast, K, your true potential shall be unleashed.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.040
Exactly.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:54.880
And the path to unleashing it lies in imagining the punishment games.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:59.800
Imagining the punishment games? Cloud, what do you mean?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:03.000
Just think about it. Punishment games!

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.460
Take, for example, Rena-chan.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:11.280
If you beat her, you could have her wear a maid costume.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.310
Rena wearing a... maid costume?

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:19.130
Though, it wouldn't be much of a punishment game if you simply dress her up.

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:21.650
W-What are you suggesting, Cloud?

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.820
Just one thing.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:30.870
Perhaps you could have her help you enjoy a nice, refreshing yoghurt?

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.830
Help me... enjoy?

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:49.230
Of course, she wouldn't be using her hands.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:55.040
And the yoghurt might drip,

00:04:55.040 --> 00:05:00.600
making a terrible mess of her breasts and her mouth.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:09.620
Wow! That'd be quite the sight.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:21.380
Don't mind if I do!

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:30.410
That was just a playful example of how to have a girl show off her charms.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:35.140
Though it appears to have been a bit too much of a shock for a minor like Maebara-san.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:40.900
Cloud! I didn't know you were such an expert on things like this!

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:46.730
You can leave all the dirty ideas to old Cloud!

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:50.410
All right! You're the best, Cloud!

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.820
But there's still so much more, K!

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:55.660
After that we'll use the Angel Mort costume!

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.230
Right! That one's got to be Rika-chan!

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:03.120
I can't wait to take advantage of that cute face of hers!

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.750
I have a perfect idea.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:11.130
In short, we'll have her take on all of our chores.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.130
Huh?

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.680
For example... wiping glass.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:24.210
Hm, Tommy. It's an intriguing idea, but I can't say it really sets my heart on fire.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.440
I wonder, Cloud.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:30.730
Try telling me that after hearing this!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.160
It's a bit of a tight fit...

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:40.830
Exactly! And that tightness is the heart and soul of my idea!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.340
Now onto the main event...

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.400
We'll have Rika-chan wipe the windows.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.880
W-Windows?

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:51.130
But...

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:54.030
...she'll be using her rear!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.860
This is kind of embarrassing...

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:07.360
Wipe... wipe... wipe... wipe...

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:12.550
This is so embarrassing...

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:18.370
Wipe... wipe... wipe... wipe...

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:21.370
Wonderful! That's just wonderful, Rika-chan!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:31.510
It would be a thrill to watch from either side of the glass!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:34.810
I'd expect no less from a dedicated bird photographer.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:36.010
It's an approach I'd never have thought of.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:40.440
What do you think of the punishment game I came up with, then?

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.390
Tommy! You're the best!

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:46.520
Next up is Mion-san...

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:51.140
She's the one responsible for dressing you up in all those embarrassing outfits, right?

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:56.960
Shall we think up a super-embarrassing punishment game, tailored to her exact specifications?

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.790
Mion's exact specifications?

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.910
When you think Mion-san, you think twins.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:07.530
So she's going to do her punishment game together with her twin sister, Shion-san!

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:10.860
Wow! Just what I'd expect from Iri the mad scientist!

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:14.180
A punishment game together with... Shion?

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.370
Exactly.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:31.570
Consider, if you will, an Angel Mort double special event. A sweet spin on body sushi!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.710
This is embarrassing, Shion...

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.790
It's embarrassing for me, too.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.210
Be brave.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:52.590
No!

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.220
Hooray!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:55.470
This is so perverted!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.970
Hooray!

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:58.720
Hooray!

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.440
Hooray!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.220
Hooray!

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:07.540
The bare peaks of two fleshy mountains poking through whipped cream and chocolate...

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:11.590
...shining ever brighter as Shion-chan uncovers them.

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:14.290
Simply irresistible!

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.560
It brings tears to my eyes!

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:19.990
Iri! You're amazing! You're too awesome!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.570
This is just the opening event, K!

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.500
After Mion-chan and Shion-chan, we have... Satoko-chan!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.040
With Satoko-chan, we won't go with a costume.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:32.960
We'll simply shift her to the most... fitting location for her punishment game.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.310
The most fitting location?

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:37.510
That is...

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:39.760
...the bath!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.260
T-The bath...

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.630
Oh! Through clouds of steam...

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:51.590
A special glimpse of Satoko in a bath towel!

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:56.020
N-Nii-nii...

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:58.910
Today I'm going to make...

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:02.660
...your body all nice and clean.

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:05.910
This is special!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:09.420
There's just no other word for it!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:14.550
I'll cover you in bubbles, and give you a good scrub.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.550
Amazing!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.100
This is the best!

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:22.340
Though it's kind of taking punishment games too far...

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:24.520
No, forget it! I don't care!

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:26.680
I could die like this!

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:31.170
It's hard to wash you if you move around so much.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:33.290
Please try to be patient.

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:35.570
Scrub scrub...

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:38.570
Scrub scrub...

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:41.500
Scrub scrub...

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:43.600
Scrub scrub...

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:47.020
I can't take any more!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.760
Hey, K. Are you all right, K?

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.790
It looks like K got a little overexcited.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:01.010
Pull yourself together, K.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.870
It seems you still need more training.

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.120
There's nothing else for it.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:12.290
It's time we brought in a special guest to further K's training.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:13.980
A-A special guest?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:19.750
C-Cloud, are you suggesting that we open the forbidden ritual room?

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:21.490
Y-You can't be serious, Cloud!

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:23.010
Exactly!

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:27.350
She's Hinamizawa's greatest mystery. Its secret flower garden.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:28.620
Hanyuu-san!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.480
H-Hanyuu!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:38.000
What? Isn't that just the shrine maiden outfit she always wears?

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:41.880
Take a closer look.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:47.390
Y-You mean the kimono is made out of... paper?

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.450
Precisely!

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:52.390
P-Paper... Then that means...

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:56.900
K-Keiichi!

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.600
It's time for your punishment game.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.520
You'd better start running.

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:03.160
If you don't, I'll take this water and squi-

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.410
No, SOAK you.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.410
Keiichi's turned into a demon!

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.190
Come on! Come on!

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.040
Pew! Pew! Pew!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.920
It's cold!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:23.560
Better run away quick, or pretty soon your paper kimono...

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:27.050
...will be stuck to your skin, and I'll see right through it!

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:30.040
Y-You're so perverted!

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.460
You think you can hide from me there?

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.310
Pew! Pew!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.820
It's cold!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:41.820
Now the chest's going transparent!

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.430
This is blasphemy!

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:49.370
Oyashiro-sama will curse you for this!

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.840
Stop it! Stop it! You can't, K!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.960
You'll never be able to win if you're in that st-

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:06.650
It seems you need more training yourself.

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:13.110
Then next up, how about a punishment game with a devilishly seductive older woman?

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:16.800
Devilishly seductive? You mean Takano-san, right?

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.110
T-Takano-san?

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.720
I've got it.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:24.710
Her voluptuous body would look ravishing in a bunny suit.

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:27.720
And if she's going to be a bunny,

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:31.320
she's got to have a lighter in her cleavage.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:36.660
Ah, but since we have club activities at school,

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:42.350
I'd rather see her do it with a recorder.

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:52.390
Then, if you would, Takano-san.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:56.970
My, I suppose there's no helping it. I lost fair and square.

00:13:56.970 --> 00:14:02.650
Though I don't suppose it'll take me many blows to finish you all off.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.780
T-That's...

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.710
One blow...

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.340
Two blows...

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.880
Three blows...

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:21.840
I can't take any more!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:26.720
Devil woman!

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:30.380
Snap out if it!

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.230
Come back to us!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.060
It's not your time yet, K!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.680
W-What happened to me?!

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:39.380
That was close.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:42.830
A little more, and you would have been completely swallowed by the dark side.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:46.070
It looks like you need even more training, K.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:50.040
"Even more"? Who else is left?

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.440
Looks like you've forgotten.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.450
There's still Chie-sensei.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.530
She preaches discipline and order to her students.

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:58.570
There's no way she'd disrespect the rules of a punishment game.

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:01.470
A-A punishment game for Chie-sensei?

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:03.840
I'd never thought of that.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:08.170
If Takano-san is charming in a devilish way,

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.970
then Chie-sensei is like an angel.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:16.230
Chie-sensei's best point is her rear, right?

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:21.270
Precisely. It looks so perky and firm.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.140
Then how about this, K?

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:26.900
Chie-sensei at the front of the class, teaching you about her rear!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.860
T-Teaching me about her rear?!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.950
Ah, no, not teaching you about her rear.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.010
Teaching you art with her rear.

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.240
You know, modelling for you and stuff.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.460
I see.

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:41.820
We'd have her do her punishment game in front of her students, while teaching!

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:43.110
I've got it!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:48.020
We'll have her hold a really embarrassing pose for thirty minutes,

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:51.480
and use her as a still life model!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:55.510
A-A still life model?!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:16:00.310
Go on then, Chie-sensei.

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:04.930
N-No! A punishment game like this is going too far!

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:09.240
Maebara-kun, is there no other punishment game?

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.530
Chie-sensei!

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:16.400
Trying to bend the rules? That's not setting a very good example to your students, is it?

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:23.670
All you need to do is move your rear a little closer, and let us draw you.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:27.260
We're only asking for you to be a still life model for us.

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.530
B-But...

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:32.410
Making me do something this embarrassing...

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:34.550
It's too cruel, Maebara-kun!

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:41.310
Let's hurry up and get started, Chie-sensei!

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:44.310
P-Principal!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:48.740
Principal! Help me! Maebara-kun is...

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:53.570
You both agreed to this, so my hands are tied.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.810
There's nothing else for it, Chie-sensei.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:17:01.080
As an educator, you're going to have to respect the rules, and complete your punishment game.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:05.080
Principal! I knew you'd understand!

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:09.840
What sort of punishment game is it, Ryuuguu-kun?

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:12.460
Um... What was it again?

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:16.360
He said she had to move her rear closer, and...

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:18.220
You've got it wrong, Rena-san.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.930
He said something about still life...

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:26.850
In other words, Keiichi is studying Chie's rear.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.110
Study?! Still life?!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:35.110
I won't have you making a mockery of this sacred place of education!

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:49.580
What's wrong, Kei-chan?!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.570
Did you have a scary dream? Did you?

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:55.630
Was it a dream?

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:59.940
It got pretty freaky at the end there.

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:04.270
Though up until then it was great.

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:07.940
That creepy laugh...

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:15.280
I'll bet he was dreaming about winning against us, and giving us all really embarrassing punishment games.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.800
Crap! That was right on the mark.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.660
You guys are as sharp as ever.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.770
But it was so good...

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:24.650
I wish I could make it a reality.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:29.270
It's so sad that you can only be happy in your dreams.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:34.300
It's pretty annoying knowing that you made me do something embarrassing, even in a dream.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:37.280
Then how about this?

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.800
We'll pay him back for it with some fantasy situations of our own.

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.890
Bring it on!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:47.430
No matter what you guys imagine, it's not going to hurt me one bit!

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:50.050
That's what you think, Kei-chan!

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:56.690
We're going to be planning what to do to you next time you lose.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:04.190
If it were up to me, I'd make him play baseball in a maid costume.

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:05.830
For the Hinamizawa Fighters?

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.150
You always have the best ideas, Rika-chan!

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:18.620
Hey! T-Tomitake-san!

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:22.970
Keiichi-kun, you're awesome! That embarrassed look is just wonderful!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.100
Put your hips into it a bit more!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:31.240
Maid culture is as old as baseball itself.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:35.210
So it's possible that your maid costume is closer to baseball's roots than an actual uniform!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:40.240
Indeed, you could say it's entirely appropriate for baseball!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:51.000
You guys! That's just way too cruel!

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:57.060
There's nothing you can do, Keiichi.

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:58.740
We lost, after all.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:19:59.570
Why?

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:02.260
Why are you here all of a sudden, Satoshi?

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:06.760
We lost today, but we'll definitely win next time.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:11.520
Lost? What do you mean? This is just a...

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:15.400
Right. I'll go first.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:20.370
I've just got to feed you with this spoon, right?

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:27.440
H-Hey, wait!

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:29.410
What're you doing?!

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:33.400
What's wrong, Keiichi?

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:37.350
If you don't eat it soon, it'll drip.

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:41.550
Why do two guys have to do this together?!

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:44.800
My heart's been racing this whole time, too...

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:46.330
So...

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:50.340
No, it's just embarrassing, or... no, really creepy.

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:55.060
I'll happily eat yoghurt if it's yours, Keiichi.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:02.780
S-Stop it! No!

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:12.830
This is... the coach's clinic...

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:16.390
Was I dreaming?

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:18.450
He's sleeping now.

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:21.820
But when he wakes up, he'll go back to the world of delusions.

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:25.470
And the more he succumbs to his desires, the more he'll slip into that world.

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:32.220
Yes. Eventually, he'll reach the point where he'll no longer be able to tell the difference between illusion and reality.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:36.330
He'll lose his life in a world of pleasure and shame?

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:39.720
Precisely. That is True Hinamizawa Syndrome.

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:45.100
It's rather ironic that the first person affected should be Maebara Keiichi-kun.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:50.620
I'm... the first person to contract True Hinamizawa Syndrome?

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:56.700
I'll notify Tokyo. Please watch over him until we receive further instructions.

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:58.160
Leave it to me.

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:12.670
True Hinamizawa Syndrome?

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:17.380
What a fortunate turn of events.

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.880
If I can use this virus correctly,

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:23.450
every man in the world will bow before me,

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:28.380
and I shall rule as their irresistible queen!

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:32.210
You are now mine.

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:37.540
We won't let you have your way, perverted nurse!

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:40.420
Black hearted, greedy adult.

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:44.050
We, the protectors of Hinamizawa's love and peace...

00:22:44.530 --> 00:22:46.390
...will never forgive you!

00:22:46.390 --> 00:22:47.550
Nipah!

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:52.200
Lay one hand on me, and Maebara Keiichi loses his life!

00:22:54.590 --> 00:23:01.400
True Hinamizawa Syndrome has already turned Kei-chan into a perverted monster...

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:03.310
I'm sorry, Kei-chan,

00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:06.290
but in order to make sure that the virus doesn't spread any further,

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:10.100
I'm going to have to kill you along with her!

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:17.830
Wait!

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:30.450
Ooishi-san, it's a call from outside.

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:32.970
Excuse me a moment.

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:37.660
Hello, this is Ooishi. Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:38.580
Hello?

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:41.170
I-Is that Ooishi-san?! Hello?!

00:23:41.170 --> 00:23:43.350
Is that you, Maebara-san?

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:46.800
What's wrong? What are you so worked up about?

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:50.320
T-To begin with, I thought it was just a normal dream...

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:53.740
No, just us talking about our fantasies,

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:57.490
but now things are really weird!

00:23:57.490 --> 00:23:59.660
Calm down, Maebara-san!

00:23:59.660 --> 00:24:02.080
I'll send a patrol car your way.

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:03.320
It'll be there in three minutes.

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:05.380
Just try and hold out until then.

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:07.620
Three minutes is too long.

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:09.880
I'm already...

00:24:11.070 --> 00:24:12.450
...surrounded.

00:24:13.700 --> 00:24:18.680
Don't worry. We took care of Takano-san.

00:24:20.540 --> 00:24:22.070
S-Stop it!

00:24:22.070 --> 00:24:25.470
A-At least be gentle!

00:24:27.340 --> 00:24:28.350
Hello!

00:24:28.640 --> 00:24:30.020
Hello!

00:24:30.020 --> 00:24:31.680
Can you hear me, Maebara-san?

00:24:31.680 --> 00:24:32.930
Maebara-san!

00:24:32.930 --> 00:24:37.000
I don't know how this happened.

00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:44.740
By the time you've learned of this, I'll probably already be lost in the labyrinth of pleasure.

00:24:45.450 --> 00:24:48.510
Please, somehow, expose the truth.

00:24:49.160 --> 00:24:52.990
That is all I ask of you.

00:24:52.990 --> 00:24:55.690
Maebara Keiichi.

00:25:18.470 --> 00:25:20.920
It was all a dream?

00:25:20.920 --> 00:25:23.910
What a horrible dream...

00:25:23.910 --> 00:25:27.010
True Hinamizawa Syndrome, huh?

00:25:27.010 --> 00:25:29.300
There's no way something like that could be real.

00:25:31.830 --> 00:25:34.840
This is all because of the club's damn punishment games!

00:25:34.840 --> 00:25:39.350
God! Buddha! Why can't I win?!

00:25:43.410 --> 00:25:45.100
K! How can you be so cold?!

00:25:46.510 --> 00:25:48.350
Praying to any deity that will listen.

00:25:48.350 --> 00:25:53.230
Shouldn't you ask your loyal companions for help first?

00:25:53.730 --> 00:25:56.610
Soul Brothers, assemble!

00:25:56.610 --> 00:25:59.490
Everything will be fine now that we're here!

00:25:59.770 --> 00:26:05.120
We're going to give those girls something to be embarrassed about!

00:26:05.120 --> 00:26:09.330
We'll make them do this... and that... and that, too...

00:26:10.820 --> 00:26:15.510
We'll grant your wish, and give you the power to win against the club members!

00:26:19.010 --> 00:26:21.260
Thank you!

00:26:23.840 --> 00:26:27.140
This seems strangely familiar...

00:26:27.690 --> 00:26:30.020
What're you worrying about, K?

00:26:30.020 --> 00:26:33.400
Let us cast our fears aside, and seize the power to win!

00:26:33.400 --> 00:26:39.190
Yes. We'll draw out the powers of delusion that lurk within you.

00:26:39.780 --> 00:26:42.030
D-Delusion...?

00:26:44.340 --> 00:26:46.040
Delusion.

00:26:50.350 --> 00:26:55.420
Y-You mean... True Hinamizawa Syndrome?
